---

<section id="comparison" class="relative pb-20 md:pb-32 scroll-mt-16 sm:scroll-mt-20">
  <!-- Section Divider with embedded kicker badge -->
  <SectionKicker title="Comparison" />

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-16 sm:pt-24 font-ui">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-pysideText">
        Strengths and Weaknesses <br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amityRed via-amityRedLight to-amityYellow glow-red-text">
          An Honest Comparison
        </span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 font-reading text-base sm:text-lg text-pysideTextSecondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Choosing an agent platform means deciding between utilitarian task daemons and subjective, anthropomorphic minds. Here is an unfiltered architectural breakdown across the five primary agent paradigms, covering cognitive depth, memory, privacy, and local sovereignty.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile Column Switcher (Visible on mobile/tablet, hidden on desktop lg+) -->
    <div class="lg:hidden mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-pysideBg border border-pysideBorder shadow-inner-pyside text-[11px] font-mono">
      <span class="text-pysideTextMuted text-[10px] uppercase font-bold shrink-0">Mobile View:</span>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-filter-default"
          class="filter-pill active px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border text-white bg-pysideCard border-amityYellow/50 font-medium transition-all shrink-0"
        >
          Cloud Giants (Default)
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-filter-oss"
          class="filter-pill px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border text-pysideTextMuted hover:text-white bg-pysideBg border-pysideBorder font-medium transition-all shrink-0"
        >
          Open Source (OpenClaw)
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-filter-all"
          class="filter-pill px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border text-pysideTextMuted hover:text-white bg-pysideBg border-pysideBorder font-medium transition-all shrink-0"
        >
          All 5 Frameworks
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table Card Container -->
    <div class="pyside-card rounded-3xl border border-pysideBorder shadow-amity-red overflow-hidden relative">
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse table-fixed min-w-[720px] lg:min-w-full" id="framework-table">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-pysideBorder bg-pysideBgDarkest">
              
              <!-- Column 1: Feature Dimension (Consistent 1/6 width on desktop) -->
              <th scope="col" class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-5 w-1/4 lg:w-1/6 min-w-[170px] lg:min-w-[195px] bg-black/25 col-framework-dim">
              </th>
              
              <!-- Column 2: Open Amity (Consistent 1/6 width on desktop) -->
              <th scope="col" class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-5 w-1/4 lg:w-1/6 min-w-[170px] lg:min-w-[195px] bg-pysideCard/90 border-x border-amityRed/30 relative col-framework-amity">
                <div class="text-white font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">Open Amity</div>
              </th>

              <!-- Column 3: OpenClaw (Consistent 1/6 width on desktop) -->
              <th scope="col" class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-5 lg:w-1/6 min-w-[170px] lg:min-w-[195px] col-framework-claw hidden lg:table-cell">
                <div class="text-pysideText font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">OpenClaw</div>
              </th>

              <!-- Column 4: OpenAI Dots (Consistent 1/6 width on desktop) -->
              <th scope="col" class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-5 w-1/4 lg:w-1/6 min-w-[170px] lg:min-w-[195px] col-framework-dots table-cell">
                <div class="text-pysideText font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">OpenAI Dots</div>
              </th>

              <!-- Column 5: Grok Bots (Consistent 1/6 width on desktop) -->
              <th scope="col" class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-5 w-1/4 lg:w-1/6 min-w-[170px] lg:min-w-[195px] col-framework-grok table-cell">
                <div class="text-pysideText font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight">Grok Bots</div>
              </th>

